#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Glibc has an B<ioperm>()  prototype both in I<E<lt>sys/io.hE<gt>> and in "
#| "I<E<lt>sys/perm.hE<gt>>.  Avoid the latter, it is available on i386 only."
msgid ""
"glibc has an B<ioperm>()  prototype both in I<E<lt>sys/io.hE<gt>> and in "
"I<E<lt>sys/perm.hE<gt>>.  Avoid the latter, it is available on i386 only."
msgstr ""
"Glibc posee un prototipo B<ioperm>() tanto en I<E<lt>sys/io.hE<gt>> como en "
"I<E<lt>sys/perm.hE<gt>>. Evite el último, sólo está disponible en la "
"arquitectura i386."

